## Google Gemini

Convera uses the **Google Gemini API** to generate AI-powered reply suggestions.

Gemini, its AI models, API, related technology, trademarks, and associated intellectual property are **not owned by the Convera project or its author**.

Google and Gemini are trademarks and/or properties of Google and are subject to Google's own terms, licenses, and policies.

Convera does not claim ownership of Gemini or any Google technology.

Users who use the Gemini functionality are responsible for obtaining and using their own Gemini API credentials and complying with Google's applicable terms and policies.

## AI-Generated Content

Convera is an interface/wrapper that sends relevant information to Gemini and displays the generated suggestions.

The actual AI-generated responses are produced by Gemini, not by Convera itself.

AI-generated content may contain mistakes, inaccurate information, or inappropriate suggestions. Users are responsible for reviewing generated content before sending it to customers or using it for business purposes.

